    "description": "10 years after a mysterious meteorite crashes to Earth, people called &#34;Rams Carriers&#34; develop superhuman abilities called &#34;Rams&#34;. However, those who develop these special abilities can only survive in the presence of the &#34;Mebius Dust&#34; released by a giant crystal, and so they are forbidden from leaving the town of Shinkatsushika.<br><br>Within Shinkatsushika, Rams Carrier children use their Rams to play a territory-conquering game to alleviate their boredom at being unable to leave town. High school student Araki along with his younger sister, Stella, and his childhood friend, Olga, form a team called &#34;Polis Hopper&#34; and throw themselves into the game. Their destinies begin to change when Professor Yuda, a researcher who studies Rams, asks them to participate in a certain experiment...<br><br>(Source: Official Site)",
